&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to: &lt;/strong&gt;Chief Commercial Officer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in the UK and requires an existing right to work in the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and scale Kaluza&#39;s future-state marketing function from the ground up, establishing a clear narrative &quot;north star&quot; across brand, comms, content, and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute hands-on across the full marketing lifecycle, personally crafting thought leadership and producing high-craft content without leaning heavily on external agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Crafting and maintaining the company narrative and storytelling, from northstar overarching company position through to granular level materials and maintaining high grade company messaging throughout.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain complete ownership of brand equity, visual identity, and content distribution channels to ensure high message quality rather than high-volume noise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and deliver an end-to-end communications, PR, and physical events strategy that builds real-world brand presence and industry authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion AI enablement across design, editing, and production workflows to boost output quality and speed without sacrificing authenticity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, develop, and mentor an agile team across comms, content, and events, embedding a shared appetite for AI-empowered execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Ideally you&#39;ll have/be:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record leading full-cycle marketing within a high-growth, small-to-medium B2B SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;World class storytelling and marketing communication skills, completed by excellent personal communications skills including high presence speaker capability.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional storytelling and hands-on content production skills, with a track record of transforming technical software concepts into compelling content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end expertise spanning brand identity, comms, PR, event strategy, and content distribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to hire and manage high-performing team members across communications, events, and content disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using AI tools across design, editing, and content workflows to enhance creative velocity and production standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What will set you apart:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience in energy technology, climate tech, or complex B2B infrastructure software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong portfolio of self-produced content, video, or published thought leadership showcasing high craft and narrative clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together.&lt;/p&gt;
